  {
   "id": "hdr_sticky",
   "name": "HEADER",
   "parameters": {
    "content": "# NZAMY · Service Requests\n\nClient↔lawyer notifications (app-side push). Supabase cred `nzamy` resolves recipient email/phone.\n\n• **2.1** New request → notify Nzamy (`/new-request`)\n• **2.2** Assigned → Compose → **Resolve client (Supabase)** → notify client (`/request-assigned`)\n• **2.3** Completed → Compose → **Resolve client** → review (`/request-completed`)\n• **2.4** 48h SLA → **Supabase getAll stale** → filter → notify admin (cron)\n\nDelivery = DUMMY (POST $env.NZAMY_DELIVERY_URL) until Evolution/email wired.",
    "height": 300,
    "width": 820
   },
   "position": [
    -80,
    -220
   ],
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1
  },
